Subject: mm-suppress-mm-memoryo-warning-on-older-compilers-if-config_numa_balancing-fix

add comment

Cc: Mel Gorman <mgorman@suse.de>
Signed-off-by: Andrew Morton <akpm@linux-foundation.org>
---

 mm/memory.c |    2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff -puN mm/memory.c~mm-suppress-mm-memoryo-warning-on-older-compilers-if-config_numa_balancing-fix mm/memory.c
--- a/mm/memory.c~mm-suppress-mm-memoryo-warning-on-older-compilers-if-config_numa_balancing-fix
+++ a/mm/memory.c
@@ -3590,7 +3590,7 @@ static int do_pmd_numa_page(struct mm_st
 		     unsigned long addr, pmd_t *pmdp)
 {
 	BUG();
-	return 0;
+	return 0;	/* An old avr32 compiler needs this */
 }
 #endif /* CONFIG_NUMA_BALANCING */
 
